<div class="wrap prose"><p class="muted">Nov 19, 2026 · Data from the Nov 19 nightly run, compared with Nov 12 · generated from the nightly reports</p>
<h1 class="ph">Mid-week check, Nov 19: 906 of 1,075 agent add-on installs passed</h1>
<p class="answer">As of Nov 19, 2026, 906 of 1,075 sandboxed installs of agent skills, plugins and MCP servers passed in Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor and Pi (86.3% of the 1,050 we can judge without an API key). A week earlier (Nov 12) it was 866 of 1,070 (83.3%). 6 add-on installs broke (failed two nights running) and 41 got fixed since Nov 12.</p>
<h2>How did each agent do this week?</h2>
<div class="tw"><table class="matrix"><thead><tr><th>Agent</th><th>Passed (Nov 19)</th><th>Rate</th><th>Nov 12</th><th>Change (points)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/works-in/claude-code/">Claude Code</a></th><td>339 / 367</td><td>92.4%</td><td>91.2%</td><td>+1.2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/works-in/grok-build/">Grok Build</a></th><td>352 / 382</td><td>92.1%</td><td>91.3%</td><td>+0.8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/works-in/codex/">Codex</a></th><td>96 / 115</td><td>83.5%</td><td>76.1%</td><td>+7.4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/works-in/pi/">Pi</a></th><td>87 / 136</td><td>64.0%</td><td>57.5%</td><td>+6.5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/works-in/cursor/">Cursor</a></th><td>32 / 50</td><td>64.0%</td><td>47.9%</td><td>+16.1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Each agent is tested on different add-ons (only the kinds it supports), so this shows how ready those add-ons are, not a ranking of the agents.</p>
